# menu.tas: a tour of the menu demo. 60 ticks each second.
# The keyboard, a gamepad and the mouse move the focus. Each step
# changes a setting that applies at once to the cow behind the menu.
# mouse_move moves the pointer from its last place (it starts at 0, 0).

# Main screen: Tab to Settings, then Enter.
60 keydown Tab
62 keyup Tab
100 keydown Enter
102 keyup Enter
# Settings: Enter opens Graphics.
140 keydown Enter
142 keyup Enter
# Graphics: the preset list. Up two times, then Enter: Low.
190 keydown Up
192 keyup Up
210 keydown Up
212 keyup Up
230 keydown Enter
232 keyup Enter
# Anti-aliasing: off, then FXAA, then MSAA.
290 keydown Tab
292 keyup Tab
330 keydown Enter
332 keyup Enter
380 keydown Enter
382 keyup Enter
# Shadows on again, then the fog off.
